  "discovery_summary": "Discovered one reusable skill for generating RDKit RECAP terminal molecular fragments with Recap.RecapDecompose and root.GetLeaves(). The skill clarifies terminal leaves versus full hierarchy, documents valid empty results, and covers minFragmentSize and onlyUseReactions. It directly packages the existing public API and does not invent chemistry; evidence is grounded in the Recap.py source and BSD-3-Clause license.",
